https://github.com/elazarg/nakdimon at commit
5b73cdd6a43ad465faabc8c1118933592df356c8. Parts follow the port in
src/piper/hebrew/__init__.py by Michael Hansen, at commit
d76f335d9eb5dea5ef6d7d70b2d6114e6303fa08 (the module docstring names the
repository), which ships this licence in the same directory. Both are under
